# zdr-coder configuration.
#
# Required: ONE value below.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#   $EDITOR .env            # set RUNPOD_API_KEY
#
# Then deploy:
#   ./scripts/deploy.sh sonnet      # default profile
#   ./scripts/deploy.sh haiku       # cheapest (~$0.27/hr)
#   ./scripts/deploy.sh opus        # best (~$23.92/hr)
#   ./scripts/deploy.sh all         # all 3 in parallel (background)
#
# Once deployed, switch models in Cline by changing Model ID to haiku/sonnet/opus.
#

# RunPod API key.  https://www.runpod.io/console/user/settings
RUNPOD_API_KEY=


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional overrides. Profile defaults live in scripts/deploy.sh.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Use original HuggingFace instead of the no-token HF-Mirror:
# HF_TOKEN=hf_...

# Custom container image (default: ghcr.io/dealright/zdr-coder-gpu:latest, public):
# GPU_IMAGE=ghcr.io/yourname/zdr-coder-gpu:latest

# Per-deploy overrides apply only when running that profile. Example:
#   GPU_COUNT=4 ./scripts/deploy.sh sonnet
